tt-local-generator (0.58.4) noble; urgency=medium

  * ui(create): possibilities-wall tile art now comes ONLY from curated
    collections — the per-type playlists (Ansis, Palettes, Verses,
    Animatediffs, …, matched by name) and any demo/favorite playlist,
    preferring starred picks — instead of surfacing an arbitrary recent
    generation (which had put unflattering/test images on the medium tiles).
    A medium with no curated sample falls to the clean per-kind gradient.

